entries[442290] = { ["name"] = "Art of the Glaive", ["text"] = "Vengeance\nConsuming 20 Soul Fragments or casting The Hunt converts your next Throw Glaive into Reaver's Glaive.\n\nReaver's Glaive :\nThrow a glaive enhanced with the essence of consumed souls at your target, dealing (345% of Attack Power) Physical damage and ricocheting to 2 additional enemies.\n\nBegins a well-practiced pattern of glaivework, enhancing your next and Soul Cleave.\n\nThe enhanced ability you cast first deals 10% increased damage, and the second deals 20% increased damage.\n\nHavoc\nConsuming 6 Soul Fragments or casting The Hunt converts your next Throw Glaive into Reaver's Glaive.\n\nReaver's Glaive :\nThrow a glaive enhanced with the essence of consumed souls at your target, dealing (345% of Attack Power) Physical damage and ricocheting to 2 additional enemies.\n\nBegins a well-practiced pattern of glaivework, enhancing your next Chaos Strike and Blade Dance.\n\nThe enhanced ability you cast first deals 10% increased damage, and the second deals 20% increased damage." }
